# SPR421 Papermorph — build context excludes
#
# The published site is the SPR421 / SIP421 bookshelf only. The rest of site/
# is upstream sample books (linear-algebra, pandemic, meiji, ...) that are not
# on the shelf; copying them made the image ~1.6 GB instead of ~30 MB.

# Ignore all of site/, then re-include only what the shelf serves.
site/*
!site/index.html
!site/404.html
!site/lib/
!site/assets/
!site/su3-indictments/
!site/su5p1-plea-guilty/
!site/su5p2-plea-not-guilty/
!site/su6-trial-verdict/
!site/su7p1-sentence/
!site/su7p2-sentence-procedure/
!site/sip14-defective-processes/
!site/sip15-settlement-offers/
!site/sip16-plea-counterclaim/
!site/sip17-amendment-pleadings/
!site/sip18-preparation-trial/
!site/sip19-trial-judgment/
!site/sip20-provisional-sentence/
!site/sip21-appeals-reviews/
!site/sip22-execution/
!site/sip23-debt-collection/
!site/sip24-legal-costs/
# science is off the shelf but linked from its own page, which links the clay and
# notebook editions; all three ship so those links resolve.
!site/science/
!site/physics-clay/
!site/physics-notebook/

